      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "A wretch unworthy of being named. Once an apprentice, now a raving lunatic, babbling of voices and unseen horrors. They attack at random, without reason, a danger to all. You will do the Sith a service by erasing this mistake.",
